+# TLS Certificate Verification in Development Builds
+
+No decision on TLS certificate verification in development builds is currently recorded for this project. The only recorded decisions nearby are that HTTPS is enforced for all services without exceptions and that rustls is the selected TLS library, but neither states whether certificate verification is required, relaxed, or configurable in development builds, so this policy sets no value until a decision is recorded.
